Adds:
 - RootCommandHelper / RootExplorerHelper (root shell + file manager)
 - ApkShareHelper (base APK share, split-APK merge to .apks)
 - MultiUserHelper (pm install-existing --user)
 - AdvancedPermissionsHelper (appops grants)
 - AppLongPressMenuExtension + AppSelectionManager
 - AppSelectionBottomSheet with Select All, chips, Merge/Share/Uninstall
 - WorkTabUserFolder + AppDrawerFolderSupport
 - FileProvider path config and manifest additions
